      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹0.10 (up from ₹0.018 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹301.8m (up 24% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹743.0k (up 442% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 0.2% (up from 0.1% in 3Q 2025). The increase in margin was driven by higher revenue. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 83% per year but the company’s share price has remained flat, which means it is significantly lagging earnings.",
